            <ArticleTitle>Symptom perception and respiratory sensation: clinical applications.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>737-48</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article has described symptom perception and its relation to asthma management. Underestimation of airway obstruction in persons with asthma is a common and serious problem that is linked to fatalities in persons with asthma. Strategies to identify and manage the poor perceiver have been suggested.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
